Bas Wo Ek Ghanta"
"Pata hai, log kehte hain ki bachpan ka pyaar bhulaya ja sakta hai... par wo tab tak hi sach hai jab tak aapne kisi ka intezaar na kiya ho.
Humari kahani mein koi lambi dosti ya 'best friends' wala scene nahi tha. Hum bas ek dusre ko jante the. Par mere liye? Mere liye wo jaan-pehchan hi sab kuch thi.
Mujhe aaj bhi yaad hai, mujhe pure din mein bas us raat ke waqt ka intezaar rehta tha. Wo ek-dedh ghanta... jab hum sab milkar 'Chhupa-Chhupi' khelte the.
Wo gali, wo raat ka andhera, aur wo khel... mere liye wo sirf game nahi tha. Us ek ghante mein use dekhne ke liye, main pura din kat-ta tha. Wo aati thi, hum khelte the, aur bas... wahi mere din ka sabse khoobsurat lamha hota tha. Main use door se hi pasand karta tha, par wo pasand itni gehri thi ki mujhe laga ye kabhi khatam nahi hogi.
Lekin waqt... waqt ne wo ek ghanta bhi cheen liya.
Hum bade hue, aur wo raat ka khelna band ho gaya. Wo gali suni ho gayi. Jis ek ghante ke sahare main jee raha tha, wo band ho gaya.
Kareeb do saal tak ye khamoshi chalti rahi. Humare beech koi baat nahi thi, bas wo purani yaadein thin jo mujhe sone nahi deti thin.
Mere andar ka shor itna badh gaya ki mujhe laga ab bol dena chahiye. Maine socha shayad wo meri feelings ki kadar karegi.
Maine himmat jutayi aur use bata diya... par shayad main galat tha.
Use mera pyaar nahi dikha, use wo sab 'ajeeb' laga. Wo ghabra gayi.
Baat uske ghar tak pahunch gayi. Hungama hua. Uske gharwalon ne bulaya, samjhaya, daanta... par mujhe us daant ya maar ka dukh nahi tha.
Dukh is baat ka tha ki wo wahin khadi thi, aur usne ek baar bhi meri taraf nahi dekha. Jis ladki ko dekhne ke liye main ghanton intezaar karta tha, usne us din mujhse nazrein fer li thin.
Phir wo chali gayi. Padhai ke liye, 4 saal ke liye door.
In chaar saalon mein duniya aage badh gayi, par main wahin atak gaya... usi raat ke intezaar mein. Kayi log mile, par meri nazar kisi aur par ruki hi nahi. Main bas yahi sochta raha ki kash... kash hum bade na hote aur wo 'Chhupa-Chhupi' ka khel chalta rehta.
Aur aaj... aaj chaar saal baad wo wapas aayi.
Hum takraye. Aamne-saamne.
Mera dil zor se dhadka, wahi purana ehsaas jaag gaya.
Par... humne ek dusre ko dekha aur bas guzar gaye. Aise guzre jaise hum kabhi mile hi na hon.
Wo aage badh gayi, aur main... main aaj bhi wahi khada hoon.
Fark bas itna hai ki pehle main uske 'milne' ka intezaar karta tha, aur ab... ab main bas is 'yaad' ke sahare zinda hoon.
Wo aaj bhi wahi hai, main aaj bhi wahi hoon... bas ab hum 'Anjaan' hain."
